# Crashlytics
crashlytics-build.properties

# Art assets are tracked since 2026-11-13: Unity Build Automation (no Mac here) builds iOS from GitHub's copy.
# Unity-hidden "~" folders under Sprites hold tool-only originals and stay local.
Assets/Sprites/**/*~/

# Auto-modified by Unity editor on every session — not meaningful to track
Assets/TextMesh Pro/Resources/Fonts & Materials/LiberationSans SDF - Fallback.asset
